	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Depth Marker",
	"Description": "Presentation-only depth cue: a marker on the surface under a character joined to it by a dashed line, and a hollow ring on the last platform's plane when the character is off-stage. Computed locally on every machine from the presented transform, never simulated or replicated, never created on a dedicated server. Standalone: no GAS, Network Prediction, Mover or other GSTN plugin.",
